WEBVTT

00:01.070 --> 00:04.360
<b>Asta tried to escape
the castle with Sharuami,</b>

00:04.570 --> 00:06.410
<b>and they encounter the Human King.</b>

00:07.030 --> 00:08.570
<b>Meanwhile, at Tooru's Castle,</b>

00:08.970 --> 00:13.100
<b>in front of the winged soldiers
controlled by the power of the new world,</b>

00:13.370 --> 00:14.100
<b>the demon army retreats.</b>

00:15.790 --> 00:19.000
<b>Azudra also got taken down
from Mikaros's scheme.</b>

00:21.630 --> 00:22.710
<b>Yes.</b>

00:22.710 --> 00:24.150
<b>Soon.</b>

00:25.630 --> 00:28.140
<b>Soon, this world will end,</b>

00:28.390 --> 00:30.220
<b>and we will be in a new world!</b>

00:31.720 --> 00:35.020
<b>I won't let you do as you want!</b>

02:14.980 --> 02:19.990
<b>Chosen Path</b>

02:21.080 --> 02:24.290
<b>It probably would take a few days
for Lady Vermilio to arrive.</b>

02:25.170 --> 02:27.630
<b>Tell the guys at the base to
start preparing for her welcome.</b>

02:28.170 --> 02:29.510
<b>Make sure to not make mistakes.</b>

02:30.050 --> 02:31.030
<b>Understood.</b>

02:30.080 --> 02:33.860
<b>Tracking Level 43</b>

02:30.080 --> 02:33.860
<b>Search Party Member Ruufu</b>

02:31.030 --> 02:33.140
<b>Careful on your way
to the Empire, Sandava.</b>

02:47.530 --> 02:49.860
<b>We asked a traveler on our way,</b>

02:50.320 --> 02:52.700
<b>and it seems like the bridge ahead
is broken, so we can't keep going.</b>

02:53.320 --> 02:54.570
<b>Let's take a detour.</b>

03:03.580 --> 03:05.580
<b>He's making Lady Vermilio feel better!</b>

03:05.580 --> 03:07.550
<b>I have to do something too!</b>

03:08.050 --> 03:09.940
<b>I'm going to clean up after us.</b>

03:09.940 --> 03:12.180
<b>It's fine, just let me do it.</b>

03:12.510 --> 03:13.800
<b>You must be tired after today.</b>

03:14.220 --> 03:15.850
<b>You should have some rest.</b>

03:16.560 --> 03:18.390
<b>It's not like that at all...</b>

03:18.890 --> 03:20.350
<b>It's fine, go and sleep early.</b>

03:21.670 --> 03:24.100
<b>Then, I'm going to keep watch!</b>

03:24.730 --> 03:26.440
<b>If you're too exhausted, when we need you,</b>

03:26.730 --> 03:29.190
<b>you won't be able to do
a good job carrying us.</b>

03:31.740 --> 03:33.660
<b>You don't have to push yourself too hard.</b>

03:34.320 --> 03:37.510
<b>You showing us the way is a huge help.</b>

03:38.790 --> 03:40.830
<b>We'll soon be facing more monsters.</b>

03:41.580 --> 03:44.250
<b>I want to ask you to scout
for us starting tomorrow.</b>

03:44.710 --> 03:46.000
<b>So, just go to sleep.</b>

03:47.130 --> 03:49.420
<b>Helck, Lady Anne...</b>

03:53.260 --> 03:54.760
<b>You must be tired too, Helck.</b>

03:55.220 --> 03:56.090
<b>Have some rest.</b>

03:56.550 --> 03:57.650
<b>I'm fine.</b>

03:58.060 --> 03:59.390
<b>You go and have some rest first, Anne.</b>

03:59.890 --> 04:01.490
<b>No, you first.</b>

04:01.490 --> 04:02.350
<b>No, no.</b>

04:03.190 --> 04:04.620
<b>I'm not sleepy yet.</b>

04:04.810 --> 04:06.900
<b>Then, should I pour you
some hot chocolate?</b>

04:07.520 --> 04:08.190
<b>Alright.</b>

04:10.110 --> 04:10.650
<b>Here you go.</b>

04:11.030 --> 04:12.030
<b>Thank you.</b>

04:14.030 --> 04:15.540
<b>Mmm! It's so good!</b>

04:15.540 --> 04:16.870
<b>We still have more if you want.</b>

04:20.540 --> 04:21.830
<b>Dear Vermilikins,</b>

04:22.250 --> 04:25.250
<b>If you are now moving with Helck,</b>

04:25.540 --> 04:29.250
<b>you shouldn't head to the Empire,
but to the southern part of human lands.</b>

04:29.540 --> 04:30.340
<b>Azu.</b>

04:31.880 --> 04:33.050
<b>We'll reach there soon.</b>

04:35.510 --> 04:36.800
<b>According to Harpie,</b>

04:37.140 --> 04:38.850
<b>southward of human land,</b>

04:39.050 --> 04:41.470
<b>there's a base set up
for the Imperial army.</b>

04:42.100 --> 04:43.740
<b>No need to stock up on food.</b>

04:43.870 --> 04:44.870
<b>Let's just keep going.</b>

04:45.690 --> 04:47.190
<b>We'll probably get there
in two or three days.</b>

04:47.730 --> 04:51.190
<b>Once we get there, the human land
is just a hair's breadth away.</b>

04:51.860 --> 04:54.900
<b>I see. We sure got there in no time.</b>

04:55.240 --> 04:57.570
<b>I know we've traveled a long way,</b>

04:57.820 --> 05:00.990
<b>but it feels like yesterday
we just left that island.</b>

05:01.620 --> 05:03.790
<b>It was a nice journey
filled with a lot of things.</b>

05:06.750 --> 05:07.720
<b>Oh, sorry.</b>

05:08.010 --> 05:10.670
<b>What a carefree thing to say
before heading into battle.</b>

05:11.290 --> 05:13.380
<b>No, I understand how you feel.</b>

05:13.960 --> 05:16.840
<b>I also rarely ever
left the Empire before, so.</b>

05:17.510 --> 05:19.190
<b>Everyday it all felt so new.</b>

05:19.720 --> 05:20.760
<b>What a nice journey.</b>

05:23.770 --> 05:24.870
<b>Hey, Helck.</b>

05:25.520 --> 05:26.350
<b>What is it?</b>

05:27.480 --> 05:28.230
<b>Nothing, it's...</b>

05:29.230 --> 05:33.020
<b>After Azudra finds out about the king
from the search team's Sandava,</b>

05:33.530 --> 05:37.030
<b>most likely, he'll probably
try to minimize our losses</b>

05:37.240 --> 05:38.950
<b>and come up with a new plan.</b>

05:39.990 --> 05:42.700
<b>But, no matter what plan
it'll end up being,</b>

05:43.030 --> 05:44.100
<b>we'll be pivotal to the war.</b>

05:45.910 --> 05:47.660
<b>Azudra must be thinking that no one but us</b>

05:47.960 --> 05:50.830
<b>would be able to take down the king.</b>

05:51.420 --> 05:54.170
<b>He thinks you and I will
at least be able to kill him.</b>

05:55.090 --> 05:58.180
<b>But even after killing him,
the war won't be over.</b>

05:58.720 --> 06:00.720
<b>Rather, the real war would begin then.</b>

06:02.100 --> 06:02.850
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:03.350 --> 06:06.810
<b>The next step would be defeating
the humans who have turned.</b>

06:08.390 --> 06:09.520
<b>I'm sure it'll be tough.</b>

06:10.410 --> 06:11.270
<b>It'll be fine!</b>

06:11.730 --> 06:13.440
<b>Whether it's
a hundred thousand or a million,</b>

06:13.770 --> 06:15.530
<b>I'll defeat them all!</b>

06:16.690 --> 06:17.530
<b>Idiot.</b>

06:17.990 --> 06:20.030
<b>Like I said,
don't bear it all on your own.</b>

06:22.570 --> 06:24.200
<b>You might not know this,</b>

06:24.490 --> 06:27.330
<b>but my power actually truly shines
when facing a large number of enemies.</b>

06:28.210 --> 06:29.660
<b>When it comes to mowing them down,</b>

06:29.100 --> 06:31.500
<b>I won't even lose to you.</b>

06:31.920 --> 06:32.670
<b>Probably.</b>

06:34.420 --> 06:35.230
<b>Yeah!</b>

06:35.800 --> 06:38.130
<b>Thinking about it again,
it really isn't a big deal.</b>

06:38.720 --> 06:40.970
<b>Leave the remaining winged soldiers to me.</b>

06:41.840 --> 06:44.680
<b>Azudra's troops will
help us eradicate them as well.</b>

06:45.180 --> 06:50.060
<b>All you need to care about is crushing
the king and Mikaros, those foul bastards.</b>

06:50.980 --> 06:51.620
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:51.940 --> 06:53.690
<b>Anne, thank you.</b>

06:57.730 --> 06:58.530
<b>Helck...</b>

06:58.940 --> 07:00.950
<b>This is a very painful battle.</b>

07:02.360 --> 07:03.450
<b>But don't lose.</b>

07:03.950 --> 07:05.780
<b>Not to the enemy, or to yourself.</b>

07:06.410 --> 07:08.330
<b>You can definitely overcome this.</b>

07:09.080 --> 07:11.040
<b>Yeah. You can count on me!</b>

07:19.420 --> 07:22.440
<b>Alright. Lady Vermilio's bedroom
should be okay now.</b>

07:22.440 --> 07:24.680
<b>Hey! You forgot the oranges.</b>

07:25.260 --> 07:26.150
<b>Oh, shoot!</b>

07:26.470 --> 07:27.970
<b>They should be in the cooler.</b>

07:28.350 --> 07:29.930
<b>Grab some orange juice too,
while you're at it.</b>

07:30.810 --> 07:31.600
<b>Understood!</b>

07:37.230 --> 07:39.940
<b>Enemy attack! Enemy attack!</b>

07:45.990 --> 07:47.630
<b>Just a bit more!</b>

07:47.630 --> 07:51.160
<b>I'm sure everyone's excited
to meet Lady Vermilio!</b>

07:51.540 --> 07:52.620
<b>I see!</b>

07:52.810 --> 07:55.520
<b>Not many people get to meet Lady Vermilio.</b>

07:55.520 --> 07:56.960
<b>Everyone's so happy!</b>

07:56.960 --> 07:58.210
<b>I see!</b>

07:58.880 --> 08:01.460
<b>The Heavenly Kings shouldn't be
showing themselves too much, after all.</b>

08:02.050 --> 08:04.300
<b>Most of our people don't know my face.</b>

08:04.630 --> 08:05.640
<b>I've told you about it, right?</b>

08:06.010 --> 08:07.030
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

08:07.350 --> 08:08.820
<b>You said Azudra is weird.</b>

08:09.260 --> 08:10.490
<b>It's that mountain!</b>

08:10.490 --> 08:12.680
<b>Once we get over that mountain,
it won't be long...</b>

08:12.990 --> 08:13.560
<b>Oh?</b>

08:17.060 --> 08:18.120
<b>A search party member?</b>

08:18.120 --> 08:19.690
<b>It's Ruufu!</b>

08:20.440 --> 08:23.190
<b>She's wounded! Ruufu!</b>

08:24.610 --> 08:26.700
<b>Lady Vermilio, please run!</b>

08:27.410 --> 08:28.450
<b>What happened?</b>

08:28.990 --> 08:30.510
<b>It's the winged soldiers.</b>

08:30.790 --> 08:34.210
<b>We were ambushed by the winged soldiers,
and our base got destroyed!</b>

08:36.850 --> 08:38.810
<b>I came here to look for Helck,</b>

08:38.960 --> 08:42.050
<b>but I never knew there are demons here.</b>

08:42.670 --> 08:44.970
<b>Were they planning an ambush?</b>

08:45.510 --> 08:46.930
<b>How foolish.</b>

08:52.180 --> 08:53.520
<b>Don't let a single one escape.</b>

08:53.890 --> 08:54.640
<b>After them!</b>

09:00.770 --> 09:03.490
<b>Why is the human army heading south?</b>

09:04.110 --> 09:07.820
<b>I don't think they're here because
they found out about our base.</b>

09:08.450 --> 09:11.740
<b>Their size was almost like
troops sent to attack an entire country.</b>

09:12.160 --> 09:13.620
<b>C-Could it be that</b>

09:13.830 --> 09:15.680
<b>they found out about Lady Vermilio</b>

09:15.870 --> 09:19.080
<b>and are trying to kill her
while she's off on her own?</b>

09:19.500 --> 09:21.020
<b>The size of their troops</b>

09:21.020 --> 09:24.550
<b>is also no doubt because they
know about Lady Vermilio's strength!</b>

09:25.220 --> 09:26.510
<b>That's possible.</b>

09:26.970 --> 09:29.890
<b>But in that case,
they're probably not after me.</b>

09:30.800 --> 09:31.970
<b>The person they're after...</b>

09:32.720 --> 09:33.520
<b>...is Helck.</b>

09:34.770 --> 09:37.190
<b>The humans are in fear
of Helck's strength.</b>

09:37.940 --> 09:39.410
<b>They want to make Helck go berserk</b>

09:39.520 --> 09:42.110
<b>and remove him from
the battle's frontlines.</b>

09:42.860 --> 09:44.080
<b>If that's the case,</b>

09:44.360 --> 09:48.070
<b>there's a high possibility they have
something to make that happen.</b>

09:51.910 --> 09:53.760
<b>Why am I feeling uneasy?</b>

09:54.200 --> 09:55.160
<b>It's fine.</b>

09:55.660 --> 09:57.660
<b>Helck will surely be fine.</b>

09:58.330 --> 10:00.380
<b>It'll be fine... It'll be fine...</b>

10:03.920 --> 10:04.750
<b>Anne.</b>

10:08.010 --> 10:08.840
<b>Let's go, shall we?</b>

10:10.590 --> 10:11.470
<b>Idiot.</b>

10:11.800 --> 10:13.720
<b>Why am I letting myself be carried?</b>

10:15.220 --> 10:15.890
<b>Alright.</b>

10:16.770 --> 10:18.640
<b>Helck will definitely be fine.</b>

10:21.600 --> 10:23.860
<b>The fight might be a little dangerous.</b>

10:24.570 --> 10:26.290
<b>Piwi, Harpie, stay here.</b>

10:26.570 --> 10:28.070
<b>Watch over Ruufu's injuries.</b>

10:29.900 --> 10:30.530
<b>Okay.</b>

10:34.370 --> 10:36.410
<b>Annie! Helck!</b>

10:37.040 --> 10:38.500
<b>Be careful, okay!</b>

10:55.640 --> 10:58.100
<b>Run away! Get away from here right now!</b>

11:00.520 --> 11:01.450
<b>What's going on?!</b>

11:01.450 --> 11:02.410
<b>The floor is...</b>

11:02.410 --> 11:04.190
<b>Hold on, what is this!?</b>

11:08.860 --> 11:09.740
<b>No!</b>

11:14.740 --> 11:18.100
<b>I never thought you'd
be here in Urum's Castle.</b>

11:20.040 --> 11:21.260
<b>Mikaros...</b>

11:21.500 --> 11:23.580
<b>How cruel of you.</b>

11:23.830 --> 11:27.020
<b>You abandoned your comrades
and switched sides to the demons.</b>

11:27.300 --> 11:30.220
<b>Edil must have also been quite shocked.</b>

11:30.800 --> 11:32.720
<b>Mikaros!</b>

11:40.080 --> 11:43.850
<b>That day, had Helck not been
in Urum's Castle,</b>

11:43.850 --> 11:45.910
<b>the gate would've been done to completion.</b>

11:46.310 --> 11:50.250
<b>Azudra was strong, strong enough
to be able to drive me to this point,</b>

11:50.360 --> 11:53.020
<b>but in a battle,
he's on an entire different level.</b>

11:53.020 --> 11:54.660
<b>He's an actual monster.</b>

11:54.950 --> 11:58.730
<b>How many times
did he kill me in such a short time?</b>

12:00.290 --> 12:02.890
<b>In the end,
because he wanted to save his comrade,</b>

12:02.890 --> 12:05.750
<b>Helck got sucked into that gate again.</b>

12:06.420 --> 12:11.300
<b>Thinking about what would've happened
had that gate not gone far enough to go berserk</b>

12:11.300 --> 12:12.880
<b>gives me the shivers.</b>

12:15.390 --> 12:16.900
<b>Rafaed.</b>

12:17.100 --> 12:20.890
<b>After seeing Helck again that day,
I was able to confirm for myself.</b>

12:21.680 --> 12:23.710
<b>If not handled properly,</b>

12:23.710 --> 12:26.900
<b>he would be something
far more terrifying than Azudra.</b>

12:27.270 --> 12:29.110
<b>Helck's hatred is strong,</b>

12:29.290 --> 12:30.780
<b>and his sorrow runs deep.</b>

12:31.190 --> 12:35.990
<b>He would no doubt be a huge obstacle
in our invasion of the Empire.</b>

12:36.320 --> 12:39.950
<b>Because of that,
I've constantly been observing him.</b>

12:40.740 --> 12:42.330
<b>Is he getting closer?</b>

12:43.120 --> 12:43.960
<b>Yes.</b>

12:46.710 --> 12:52.010
<b>This is a spell I made to make certain
of a selected target's location.</b>

12:54.420 --> 12:57.430
<b>It's not really that rare of a spell.</b>

12:57.680 --> 13:00.930
<b>A spell anyone would've
surely thought at least once.</b>

13:02.100 --> 13:03.120
<b>However,</b>

13:03.390 --> 13:05.910
<b>this spell requires a high casting level</b>

13:05.910 --> 13:10.320
<b>and a part of the person
you wish to locate.</b>

13:10.610 --> 13:13.330
<b>Flesh, hair, tears, or blood.</b>

13:13.330 --> 13:14.900
<b>Anything will do.</b>

13:15.190 --> 13:16.150
<b>I see.</b>

13:16.450 --> 13:19.870
<b>And that's why you
appeared in front of Helck.</b>

13:20.240 --> 13:23.580
<b>Correct. I took a bit
of his blood back then.</b>

13:23.830 --> 13:25.580
<b>I put in quite the effort.</b>

13:27.330 --> 13:30.920
<b>Helck is heading here from the south.</b>

13:31.090 --> 13:32.960
<b>He's not that far away anymore.</b>

13:33.590 --> 13:36.430
<b>There's a gate here
we can use when necessary,</b>

13:36.430 --> 13:38.840
<b>but we have to do things just in case.</b>

13:39.140 --> 13:43.600
<b>I'm thinking we should deal with him
before he gets too close to the castle.</b>

13:44.270 --> 13:45.430
<b>I'll go.</b>

13:45.730 --> 13:49.350
<b>You should first focus
on healing from your wounds.</b>

13:51.230 --> 13:53.360
<b>I'll leave you to it, then.</b>

13:53.570 --> 13:57.110
<b>Right. Have that soldier
over there go with you.</b>

13:59.780 --> 14:01.990
<b>I'm sure they'll be useful.</b>

14:02.530 --> 14:05.180
<b>Have you destroyed their psyche?</b>

14:05.790 --> 14:07.960
<b>Edil was a fail, so.</b>

14:08.290 --> 14:10.060
<b>It will be fine.</b>

14:10.250 --> 14:14.500
<b>If the curse isn't released,
by the king's will, it won't go berserk.</b>

14:15.340 --> 14:16.260
<b>I see.</b>

14:23.470 --> 14:24.570
<b>Helck.</b>

14:25.010 --> 14:27.370
<b>This is the path you chose.</b>

14:32.060 --> 14:33.360
<b>Like I'd let myself be killed!</b>

14:37.150 --> 14:37.940
<b>A new enemy?</b>

14:38.530 --> 14:39.950
<b>The power of their fire magic...</b>

14:40.320 --> 14:41.660
<b>They're not just anyone ordinary.</b>

14:44.030 --> 14:45.120
<b>This fire...</b>

14:45.580 --> 14:46.580
<b>Could it be...</b>

14:56.630 --> 14:57.860
<b>Where are the others?</b>

14:58.170 --> 14:59.800
<b>We got separated on the way.</b>

15:00.220 --> 15:01.970
<b>But I'm sure they're still alive.</b>

15:02.900 --> 15:03.750
<b>I see.</b>

15:04.350 --> 15:06.010
<b>I think this will be a fierce battle.</b>

15:06.600 --> 15:08.020
<b>Go somewhere safe.</b>

15:20.240 --> 15:21.570
<b>You seem to be doing well.</b>

15:22.030 --> 15:24.450
<b>I thought you'd be more run down by now.</b>

15:25.660 --> 15:29.330
<b>I was saved by the demons
you've always said to be evil.</b>

15:29.950 --> 15:31.080
<b>Had I been alone,</b>

15:31.500 --> 15:33.210
<b>I wouldn't be able to get this far.</b>

15:34.330 --> 15:35.250
<b>I see.</b>

15:35.790 --> 15:38.250
<b>You've met some more good comrades.</b>

15:39.300 --> 15:42.180
<b>Helck, I'll get straight to the point.</b>

15:42.630 --> 15:45.470
<b>I'm here to take you down.</b>

15:45.970 --> 15:49.020
<b>You're an obstacle to our plan.</b>

15:51.600 --> 15:53.900
<b>That tremendous power
hidden inside of you...</b>

15:54.150 --> 15:56.440
<b>You must also be aware of it by now.</b>

15:56.860 --> 16:02.030
<b>My duty here is to make that power
go berserk and remove you from the frontlines.</b>

16:02.950 --> 16:06.530
<b>But if you're willing to
leave by your own will now,</b>

16:06.820 --> 16:08.840
<b>I have no intention to battle you.</b>

16:10.040 --> 16:12.500
<b>I'll give you one final warning.</b>

16:12.960 --> 16:14.540
<b>Don't resist anymore.</b>

16:14.710 --> 16:17.210
<b>The future you wish for
doesn't exist beyond this point.</b>

16:17.710 --> 16:19.710
<b>There is no hope or salvation.</b>

16:20.460 --> 16:25.340
<b>Go live a quiet life somewhere untouched
by war along with your new comrades.</b>

16:25.840 --> 16:29.810
<b>That is the only option of
peaceful life you have left.</b>

16:30.470 --> 16:32.270
<b>No one will come to attack you.</b>

16:32.680 --> 16:36.100
<b>There is no need for you
to feel any more pain.</b>

16:36.980 --> 16:38.940
<b>Mr. Rafaed, I told you.</b>

16:39.650 --> 16:42.170
<b>I was saved by the demons.</b>

16:42.780 --> 16:45.530
<b>This fight is no longer only my own.</b>

16:46.450 --> 16:48.660
<b>No matter what kind of future awaits me,</b>

16:49.160 --> 16:51.450
<b>if you're going to attack the demon lands,</b>

16:52.040 --> 16:55.330
<b>and further cause unjust
and sorrow to them,</b>

16:56.120 --> 16:58.540
<b>then I will not falter
as I walk this path.</b>

16:59.130 --> 16:59.920
<b>I...</b>

17:00.800 --> 17:02.420
<b>...am going to destroy humans!</b>

17:04.760 --> 17:05.760
<b>I see.</b>

17:06.180 --> 17:07.300
<b>You're going to destroy us.</b>

17:07.930 --> 17:09.800
<b>If after knowing all of this,</b>

17:09.930 --> 17:12.520
<b>you still choose to walk forward...</b>

17:12.890 --> 17:14.310
<b>Then I will no longer try to stop you.</b>

17:15.310 --> 17:17.600
<b>Foolish hero, Helck.</b>

17:22.780 --> 17:23.900
<b>Let me tell you this!</b>

17:24.530 --> 17:27.490
<b>You will not be able to overcome despair!</b>

17:28.110 --> 17:31.280
<b>You won't even get to try to bear
fighting your former comrades.</b>

17:31.990 --> 17:34.910
<b>Neither will you be able to get
to that future of hopelessness.</b>

17:35.450 --> 17:38.830
<b>You're going to lose to
the tremendous power inside you.</b>

17:39.580 --> 17:41.670
<b>After losing yourself and going berserk,</b>

17:41.880 --> 17:45.840
<b>you'll become a monster who will even
bring your new comrades to their deaths!</b>

17:46.550 --> 17:48.010
<b>I'll show you I can endure it.</b>

17:48.470 --> 17:50.050
<b>Until I can fulfill my goal,</b>

17:50.390 --> 17:51.260
<b>I will surely do!</b>

17:52.430 --> 17:53.720
<b>Come!</b>

17:56.980 --> 17:59.940
<b>Right. This fight is
no longer only your own.</b>

18:00.400 --> 18:02.730
<b>I will lighten your burden.</b>

18:03.860 --> 18:05.440
<b>Do not ever forget that!</b>

18:06.740 --> 18:08.610
<b>Yeah. Of course!</b>

18:08.910 --> 18:09.660
<b>Let's go!</b>

18:28.400 --> 18:29.900
<b>That new comrade...</b>

18:30.150 --> 18:32.890
<b>She's a friend who
supports Helck mentally.</b>

18:33.300 --> 18:34.430
<b>A major support.</b>

18:35.470 --> 18:37.640
<b>However, do you realize this?</b>

18:40.100 --> 18:44.730
<b>Her existence itself is
what will make your heart weak!</b>

18:45.440 --> 18:46.070
<b>Anne!</b>

19:03.210 --> 19:04.340
<b>Hey, Helck!</b>

19:04.540 --> 19:06.880
<b>Did you think I was going to die?!</b>

19:07.300 --> 19:09.690
<b>Like I would die against
an opponent like this!</b>

19:09.880 --> 19:13.300
<b>What have you been seeing
me do all this time?! Idiot!</b>

19:13.680 --> 19:15.470
<b>Leave this guy to me!</b>

19:15.760 --> 19:19.850
<b>You don't have to worry and just
focus only on the enemy in front of you!</b>

19:20.140 --> 19:22.810
<b>Hurry up and defeat them all,
then we'll go get Piwi!</b>

19:24.270 --> 19:24.900
<b>Yeah!</b>

19:26.270 --> 19:28.960
<b>She not only was able to
dodge an attack from me,</b>

19:29.240 --> 19:33.070
<b>but she also said powerful words
that will ring throughout his heart...</b>

19:33.570 --> 19:36.280
<b>She returned Helck to
his normal state in an instant.</b>

19:36.780 --> 19:38.330
<b>Who in the world is that demon?</b>

19:41.790 --> 19:44.460
<b>You don't know anything about Helck.</b>

19:45.000 --> 19:46.290
<b>He's strong.</b>

19:48.420 --> 19:49.480
<b>Both physically and mentally,</b>

19:49.760 --> 19:52.260
<b>he's stronger than you think he is!</b>

19:56.720 --> 19:57.890
<b>He'll overcome it!</b>

19:58.220 --> 20:00.220
<b>No matter what kind of despair
he faces, he'll overcome it!</b>

20:00.520 --> 20:02.480
<b>He won't become a monster or whatever!</b>

20:06.440 --> 20:07.420
<b>We'll see about that.</b>

20:07.820 --> 20:12.360
<b>To me, it looks like he's in pain
and relying on you for support.</b>

20:12.740 --> 20:17.010
<b>If you die, he will immediately
lose to his powers!</b>

20:17.950 --> 20:19.890
<b>Like I would die to someone like you.</b>

20:20.450 --> 20:21.200
<b>However,</b>

20:21.700 --> 20:23.210
<b>even if I do get killed,</b>

20:23.620 --> 20:25.250
<b>Helck will still be fine.</b>

20:26.330 --> 20:27.920
<b>His resolve is real.</b>

20:28.460 --> 20:30.760
<b>No matter what happens,
he'll definitely get through it.</b>

20:31.460 --> 20:33.460
<b>Helck will definitely be fine.</b>

20:34.550 --> 20:35.300
<b>But...</b>

20:35.930 --> 20:36.760
<b>Why?</b>

20:37.260 --> 20:39.360
<b>I believe in him this much,</b>

20:39.720 --> 20:41.020
<b>trust in him this much,</b>

20:41.720 --> 20:44.140
<b>but why do I constantly have this feeling?</b>

20:44.850 --> 20:47.230
<b>This bad feeling... what is it?</b>

20:52.650 --> 20:54.710
<b>No, it's not aiming for me!</b>

20:57.570 --> 20:59.990
<b>Helck! A new enemy! Careful!</b>

22:44.970 --> 22:49.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:44.970 --> 22:49.970
<b>To a Future With Hope</b>

22:45.870 --> 22:48.890
<b>Next episode, "To a Future With Hope".</b>
